[{"name":"v0.3.17","uuid":"393186843","tag_name":"v0.3.17","target_commitish":"release/v0.3.17","body":"\u003e **Alpha**\r\n\u003e This Kubeflow component has alpha status with limited support. See the [Kubeflow versioning policies](https://www.kubeflow.org/docs/started/support/#application-status). The Kubeflow team is interested in your [feedback](https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/issues/new/choose) about the usability of the feature.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* chore(deps): bump k8s.io/client-go from 0.36.4 to 0.37.0 in /clients/ui/bff by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3143\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/onsi/gomega from 1.42.1 to 1.43.0 in /clients/ui/bff by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3142\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/brianvoe/gofakeit/v7 from 7.15.0 to 7.16.0 in /clients/ui/bff by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3144\r\n* chore: upgrade to go 1.26.7 by @pboyd in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3153\r\n* chore(deps): bump platformdirs from 4.11.3 to 4.11.5 in /clients/python by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3146\r\n* chore(deps): bump huggingface-hub from 1.27.0 to 1.29.0 in /clients/python by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3147\r\n* chore(deps): bump k8s.io/apimachinery from 0.36.4 to 0.37.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3140\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump ruff from 0.16.4 to 0.16.5 in /clients/python by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3145\r\n* chore(deps): bump github/codeql-action/upload-sarif from 4.37.8 to 4.37.9 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3149\r\n* chore(deps-dev): bump ray from 2.57.0 to 2.58.0 in /clients/python by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3150\r\n* chore(deps): bump platformdirs from 4.11.3 to 4.11.5 in /jobs/async-upload by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubeflow/hub/pull/3151\r\n* cho